From 8cb27ba01fbe011f609f1d2d0c834c97d783f95a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:59:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add SOF firmware and topology for WCL

Adds SOF firmware and topology files for the Wildcat Lake (WCL)
platform's onboard RT722 SoundWire audio codec, matching
the existing per-platform layout under intel/sof-ipc4{,-tplg}/.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1695
Signed-off-by: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
